# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# THIS REPOSITORY IS PUBLIC
#
# Anything committed here is world-readable and remains in git
# history even after deletion. If a secret is ever committed,
# treat it as compromised and rotate it immediately.
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ── Secrets ────────────────────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.key
*.pem
*.p12
*.pfx
id_rsa*
id_ed25519*
*_token*
*apikey*
*api_key*
CLAUDE_API_KEY*
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY*
secrets*
credentials*
*.credentials
auth.json

# ── Operational documentation ──────────────────────────────
# Internal runbooks describe live infrastructure (IP addresses,
# instance IDs, paths, security posture). Useful to us, useful
# to an attacker. Keep these out of the public repo.
docs/
*-runbook.md
*-RUNBOOK.md
UPGRADE-NOTES.md

# ── Database and backups ───────────────────────────────────
*.sql
*.sql.gz
*.dump
*.tgz
*.tar.gz
backup*

# ── Build / runtime artefacts ──────────────────────────────
vendor/
node_modules/
*.log
storage/
bootstrap/cache/

# ── OS / editor noise ──────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*~

# Local infrastructure patterns for the pre-commit hook (never publish)
.githooks/infra-patterns.local

# DOTMCP ships its own vendor/ deliberately: FreeScout commits its own
# vendor/ and adding packages there conflicts on every upgrade. The server
# cannot run composer per-module, so these must be in the repo.
!DOTMCP/vendor/
!DOTMCP/vendor/**
